  triage:title "caller_context::resolve_roster_alias duplicates resolve_roster_alias_with_owner with database-wide lookup disabled" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1310-r8 (PR #1310, AY.15 herdr-name-uniqueness, head 715ab21ea; report: PR #1310 issuecomment 5576239134). ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-AY15-F004. crates/atm-core/src/caller_context.rs:59-82 resolve_roster_alias is functionally subsumed by resolve_roster_alias_with_owner(candidate, team, roster, false). Correction: collapse resolve_roster_alias into a call to resolve_roster_alias_with_owner (or delete it and update callers) so one function owns team-scoped and database-wide alias resolution." ;
